<title>USA: America Service gets $20 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>America Service gets $20 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>America Service Group Inc said Tuesday that it has executed a $20 million, three-year credit agreement with NationsBank of Tennessee.</p>
<p>The facility provides a line of credit for working capital, acquisitions and letters of credit for performance bonding.</p>
<p>The credit agreement replaces previous facilities with Wilmington Trust Co in Wilmington, Del., it said.</p>
</text>
